ing this into our integral gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /3}\\frac{3({cot}^{2}⁡x+1)}{\\operatorname{tan}⁡x\\operatorname{csc}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x & =3{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /3}\\frac{{cot}^{2}⁡x+1}{\\operatorname{tan}⁡x\\operatorname{csc}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /3}\\frac{{csc}^{2}⁡x}{\\operatorname{tan}⁡x\\operatorname{csc}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /3}\\frac{\\operatorname{csc}⁡x}{\\operatorname{tan}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /3}\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-3\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\,{|}_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /3} \\\\  & =-3\\operatorname{csc}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3})+3\\operatorname{csc}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4}) \\\\  & =-3\\cdot \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{3}}+3\\cdot \\sqrt{2} \\\\  & =3\\sqrt{2}-2\\sqrt{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-73513/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d0ba6d15-a20e-5f16-b324-0bbead5458ca"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-73513"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-352709/field-1/7fd665466534222970f52529228684ca98c5e47c46c3c87a9b2a61a06c59f6e1" :answer/id #uuid "0b91961a-db58-56cf-9b3c-33a00726aef3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi^2}{4}-\\frac{\\pi}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-352709/field-1/76ed6730d0c1ae25001d213e523ac8d43b35cfffa7234b6cdb21a97822f5bcf2" :answer/id #uuid "6e80eadc-14bc-57f6-ad26-c06bcfe326b2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi^2}{4}+\\frac{\\pi}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-352709/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "0eb0f959-b12a-5f80-8c44-36c534ca9ca4" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-352709/field-1/7fd665466534222970f52529228684ca98c5e47c46c3c87a9b2a61a06c59f6e1" :answer-field/choices ["q-352709/field-1/7fd665466534222970f52529228684ca98c5e47c46c3c87a9b2a61a06c59f6e1" "q-352709/field-1/76ed6730d0c1ae25001d213e523ac8d43b35cfffa7234b6cdb21a97822f5bcf2"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-352709" :question/id #uuid "79cb7490-7c08-5175-a41e-d3e420d4c759" :question/math-academy-id "q-352709" :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{1}^{\\pi /2}({cot}^{2}⁡x-{csc}^{2}⁡x+2x)\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "In this case, we have to use the identity\n\n$$\n1+{cot}^{2}⁡x={csc}^{2}⁡x\\,⟹\\,{cot}^{2}⁡x-{csc}^{2}⁡x=-1.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{\\pi /2}({cot}^{2}⁡x-{csc}^{2}⁡x+2x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{1}^{\\pi /2}(2x-1)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =({x}^{2}-x)\\,{|}_{1}^{\\pi /2} \\\\  & =({(\\frac{\\pi }{2})}^{2}-\\frac{\\pi }{2})-({1}^{2}-1) \\\\  & =\\frac{{\\pi }^{2}}{4}-\\frac{\\pi }{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{{\\pi }^{2}-2\\pi }{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-352709/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d0ba6d15-a20e-5f16-b324-0bbead5458ca"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-352709"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-362808/field-1/e825eeee663936785a9d2bb4999de3fa90d98650b5c463b8ea08821d16a85254" :answer/id #uuid "9e39261b-18dc-5733-9697-439bb255e5b8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1-\\ln(2)}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-362808/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "f3ec52e3-3172-5817-9d8b-f6d977c6d516" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-362808/field-1/e825eeee663936785a9d2bb4999de3fa90d98650b5c463b8ea08821d16a85254" :answer-field/choices ["q-362808/field-1/e825eeee663936785a9d2bb4999de3fa90d98650b5c463b8ea08821d16a85254"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-362808" :question/id #uuid "134020ff-4085-5cac-902e-babc37345e8a" :question/math-academy-id "q-362808" :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{1}^{\\sqrt{e-1}}\\frac{x}{{csc}^{2}⁡x+{x}^{2}-{cot}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "In this case, we have to use the identity\n\n$$\n1+{cot}^{2}⁡x={csc}^{2}⁡x\\,⟹\\,{csc}^{2}⁡x-{cot}^{2}⁡x=1.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{\\sqrt{e-1}}\\frac{x}{{csc}^{2}⁡x+{x}^{2}-{cot}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{1}^{\\sqrt{e-1}}\\frac{x}{({csc}^{2}⁡x-{cot}^{2}⁡x)+{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{\\sqrt{e-1}}\\frac{x}{1+{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1+{x}^{2})\\,{|}_{1}^{\\sqrt{e-1}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1+(\\sqrt{e-1})^{2})-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1+(1)^{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1+e-1)-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1+1) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(e)-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(1)-\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1-\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-362808/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d0ba6d15-a20e-5f16-b324-0bbead5458ca"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-362808"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-73518/selection/676acdfeeb36f02a0eaff1d849845ee71981b017e0ca89d22f61839c021921d1" :answer/id #uuid "99528ec2-eeae-5e48-a844-17f9d6c49033" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73518/selection/bb506cf003879770dcc37d3f108f66837df546bd68c5ad9b0e1b3a27b8c6ec6c" :answer/id #uuid "2460afa4-6468-558e-8b5f-d3969f947d88" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73518/selection/4db7b6acb9a12029c5ee221cc89aa6b6e99afe642c66a6524f826023249f0403" :answer/id #uuid "bfb1efd4-0c77-54ad-9680-e2bd69d9bd44" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73518/selection/3fd32323166b71264f145886068303a1fa48423b88d338275b10460412c2bb42" :answer/id #uuid "5f15a6a1-f055-5f8f-bc84-175cbadea999" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{sin}^{2}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73518/selection/f46848454e11d668875d7233a38eab0fdeb2f7d33e5369f19a8c60210f1faf83" :answer/id #uuid "4328d492-9546-55b3-b4a8-0219f86112ea" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{cos}^{2}⁡x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73518/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "49df0dda-7518-5180-99f3-31434ba8ff99" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-73518/selection/676acdfeeb36f02a0eaff1d849845ee71981b017e0ca89d22f61839c021921d1" :answer-field/choices ["q-73518/selection/676acdfeeb36f02a0eaff1d849845ee71981b017e0ca89d22f61839c021921d1" "q-73518/selection/bb506cf003879770dcc37d3f108f66837df546bd68c5ad9b0e1b3a27b8c6ec6c" "q-73518/selection/4db7b6acb9a12029c5ee221cc89aa6b6e99afe642c66a6524f826023249f0403" "q-73518/selection/3fd32323166b71264f145886068303a1fa48423b88d338275b10460412c2bb42" "q-73518/selection/f46848454e11d668875d7233a38eab0fdeb2f7d33e5369f19a8c60210f1faf83"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-73518" :question/id #uuid "f264faf5-d252-5bbb-b1de-13589dcbcfde" :question/math-academy-id "q-73518" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+{cot}^{2}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "In this case, we have to use the identity  $1+{cot}^{2}⁡x={csc}^{2}⁡x.$ Substituting this into our integral gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+{cot}^{2}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x(1+{cot}^{2}⁡x)}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x{csc}^{2}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-73518/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d0ba6d15-a20e-5f16-b324-0bbead5458ca"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-73518"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-114441/selection/6cec8d816c0bc05c15bdf51915524a3ce0478629a3e62b3abe6b1ee4ca3f0731" :answer/id #uuid "9e1e20c1-367f-54d1-9c7f-d9c5b1cc5f8c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1-\\frac{\\pi }{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114441/selection/b644519198c5577ee9c67d3c2bda34509dad7578583bd4b906c108e9348c2cb4" :answer/id #uuid "007bfff3-34a7-579f-a25f-80d37398e51e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4-\\pi " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114441/selection/33a0f30dd583c1bcda33d9114584d58f561892bcef517adbb92658101506fa3b" :answer/id #uuid "76c4721c-608a-5b2a-af63-3ea73948552b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{2}-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114441/selection/447790f284150eca2dd73dfea166af1c322f0f7192b53161b65b09db53cf99a8" :answer/id #uuid "94ce70e0-bbfc-5cfb-8df4-695beef43819" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4(\\pi -2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114441/selection/e1051f69cdae57f04563b2aee88caf71c2041c8f366f9474891f8d48f30ab180" :answer/id #uuid "88325cef-8b8f-5608-b88d-f5b0c6eb25e5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\pi -3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114441/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "04fa0f23-46cd-5fe1-b915-ef4ed4a82b2b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-114441/selection/6cec8d816c0bc05c15bdf51915524a3ce0478629a3e62b3abe6b1ee4ca3f0731" :answer-field/choices ["q-114441/selection/6cec8d816c0bc05c15bdf51915524a3ce0478629a3e62b3abe6b1ee4ca3f0731" "q-114441/selection/b644519198c5577ee9c67d3c2bda34509dad7578583bd4b906c108e9348c2cb4" "q-114441/selection/33a0f30dd583c1bcda33d9114584d58f561892bcef517adbb92658101506fa3b" "q-114441/selection/447790f284150eca2dd73dfea166af1c322f0f7192b53161b65b09db53cf99a8" "q-114441/selection/e1051f69cdae57f04563b2aee88caf71c2041c8f366f9474891f8d48f30ab180"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-114441" :question/id #uuid "cc471bfe-2073-582d-86e5-26346f0a6a82" :question/math-academy-id "q-114441" :question/problem "${\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}{cot}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "In this case, we have to use the identity  $1+{cot}^{2}⁡x={csc}^{2}⁡x.$ Rearranging this gives\n\n$$\n{cot}^{2}⁡x={csc}^{2}⁡x-1.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}{cot}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2}({csc}^{2}⁡x-1)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =(-\\operatorname{cot}⁡x-x){|}_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi /2} \\\\  & =[-\\operatorname{cot}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})-\\frac{\\pi }{2}]-[-\\operatorname{cot}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{4})-\\frac{\\pi }{4}] \\\\  & =[-0-\\frac{\\pi }{2}]-[-1-\\frac{\\pi }{4}] \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\pi }{2}+1+\\frac{\\pi }{4} \\\\  & =1-\\frac{\\pi }{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-114441/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d0ba6d15-a20e-5f16-b324-0bbead5458ca"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-114441"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-114510/selection/a60a125e217ecade0680670626441fbfbce16e908f31026deb89f8c97fa610e5" :answer/id #uuid "de52dfe8-e93e-5581-a91b-8757a254d03b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5\\operatorname{sec}⁡(5x-2)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114510/selection/5a0779ec0f053a3341211b02ca4f2222ed4122706b2d2d40b6d8a5642c3f57b6" :answer/id #uuid "593b62b3-980f-5a45-87e3-e9b1f8053e68" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{5}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x-2)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114510/selection/2f49af9767958cffabbc42a02c23c785d5323cbec96f5f5fc5b1ba32cc5885b9" :answer/id #uuid "dd8a96a2-63ed-54f6-9b16-adaa7d19756a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x-2)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114510/selection/3872b3195a6255a7dd1ba5ec0b290b4ef9518bb27c660b726e1ba4ad1824a132" :answer/id #uuid "7c7e1298-551f-5fb5-8473-de84e7dc33d0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{5}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x-2)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114510/selection/310237259b5a9606d18ce54f198658f2be72fbfdd9626866e0eac6642349927e" :answer/id #uuid "357509ba-03f5-58f4-9788-202afde1646a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5}\\operatorname{sec}⁡(5x-2)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114510/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "11413151-b4cb-5eec-8fee-0cebfdbb8679" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-114510/selection/5a0779ec0f053a3341211b02ca4f2222ed4122706b2d2d40b6d8a5642c3f57b6" :answer-field/choices ["q-114510/selection/a60a125e217ecade0680670626441fbfbce16e908f31026deb89f8c97fa610e5" "q-114510/selection/5a0779ec0f053a3341211b02ca4f2222ed4122706b2d2d40b6d8a5642c3f57b6" "q-114510/selection/2f49af9767958cffabbc42a02c23c785d5323cbec96f5f5fc5b1ba32cc5885b9" "q-114510/selection/3872b3195a6255a7dd1ba5ec0b290b4ef9518bb27c660b726e1ba4ad1824a132" "q-114510/selection/310237259b5a9606d18ce54f198658f2be72fbfdd9626866e0eac6642349927e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-114510" :question/id #uuid "00ef3dc6-530a-55c9-8a1b-bc6f728f1e6b" :question/math-academy-id "q-114510" :question/problem "Determine $\\int \\frac{1}{{cot}^{2}⁡(5x-2)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x-2)+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x-2)}\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "From the identity $1+{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta ={csc}^{2}⁡\\theta ,$ with $\\theta =5x-2,$ we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1+{cot}^{2}⁡(5x-2)={csc}^{2}⁡(5x-2).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into our integral gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{{cot}^{2}⁡(5x-2)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x-2)+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x-2)}\\,\\text{d}x & = \\\\ \\int \\frac{1}{[{cot}^{2}⁡(5x-2)+1]\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x-2)}\\,\\text{d}x & = \\\\ \\int \\frac{1}{{csc}^{2}⁡(5x-2)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x-2)}\\,\\text{d}x & = \\\\ \\int \\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡(5x-2)}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x-2)}\\,\\text{d}x & = \\\\ \\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x-2)\\text{d}x & = \\\\ -\\frac{1}{5}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x-2)+C & .\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-114510/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "fe5822b4-c5d4-59a8-bd72-a41d3074e4e6"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-114510"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-49268"] :question/problem "$\\int {tan}^{2}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{6})\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "From the identity  $1+{tan}^{2}⁡\\theta ={sec}^{2}⁡\\theta $ with $\\theta =2x+\\frac{\\pi }{6},$ we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1+{tan}^{2}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{6}) & ={sec}^{2}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{6}) \\\\ {tan}^{2}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{6}) & ={sec}^{2}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{6})-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into our integral gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int {tan}^{2}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{6})\\text{d}x & =\\int ({sec}^{2}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{6})-1)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int {sec}^{2}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{6})\\text{d}x-\\int 1\\cdot \\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{tan}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{6})-x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-352757/field-1/ac9362c9c743a0d4cd03c825418c9d77629147a5815c12295606faadbe8a8744" :answer/id #uuid "f04e7b64-6310-5158-a90f-913f675f7d9d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-352757/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "e7f9b450-5eee-5d30-ad73-cef0a933573d" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-352757/field-1/ac9362c9c743a0d4cd03c825418c9d77629147a5815c12295606faadbe8a8744" :answer-field/choices ["q-352757/field-1/ac9362c9c743a0d4cd03c825418c9d77629147a5815c12295606faadbe8a8744"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-352757" :question/id #uuid "e4579a76-7eae-508b-b605-f6aa49421791" :question/math-academy-id "q-352757" :question/problem "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi /3}\\frac{\\operatorname{sec}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{3})}{1+{tan}^{2}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{3})}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "From the identity $1+{tan}^{2}⁡\\theta ={sec}^{2}⁡\\theta $ with $\\theta =x+\\frac{\\pi }{3},$ we get \n\n$$\n1+{tan}^{2}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{3})={sec}^{2}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{3})\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into our integral gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi /3}\\frac{\\operatorname{sec}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{3})}{1+{tan}^{2}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{3})}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi /3}\\frac{\\operatorname{sec}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{3})}{{sec}^{2}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{3})}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi /3}\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sec}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{3})}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi /3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{3})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+\\frac{\\pi }{3})\\,{|}_{0}^{2\\pi /3} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{2\\pi }{3}+\\frac{\\pi }{3})-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(0+\\frac{\\pi }{3}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi )-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3}) \\\\  & =0-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-352757/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "fe5822b4-c5d4-59a8-bd72-a41d3074e4e6"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-352757"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-114469/selection/2edc0c8899315b58c1f19bbc3c0225166645b3210be9a52a6dba529a9321dc5e" :answer/id #uuid "4ecd9746-ed07-53dd-9523-a872681c8a45" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{tan}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{5})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114469/selection/5af14187ea029aa71c669b734d9987e652ae4ba4a8166e189a7c76c9044c8a7e" :answer/id #uuid "6516a686-b959-5f41-ae89-9f1e68dd85a0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{5})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114469/selection/e56188a106379c230ac2d84d996587f30db640f77e282b3ea14a783015615c94" :answer/id #uuid "c9da0f4f-7651-5639-8054-d5bbf2c76bbb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{5})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114469/selection/36fc61ecfa68d607e5bf5fa908e1a92d1be812fee4e01001acb97c3d8100ab8e" :answer/id #uuid "35c7d8e3-ba8b-56c6-9d0a-ef82bffb261b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{sec}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{5})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114469/selection/c894e2b24406adf04a77938c2e5de816d19ed572b43e4129dc4cfbbdf5070008" :answer/id #uuid "4a19e8c6-0aaf-568b-ae01-791d7ce4c460" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{5})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114469/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "2a4a2baf-9ecf-5b5a-bd73-e41e7081a5da" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-114469/selection/c894e2b24406adf04a77938c2e5de816d19ed572b43e4129dc4cfbbdf5070008" :answer-field/choices ["q-114469/selection/2edc0c8899315b58c1f19bbc3c0225166645b3210be9a52a6dba529a9321dc5e" "q-114469/selection/5af14187ea029aa71c669b734d9987e652ae4ba4a8166e189a7c76c9044c8a7e" "q-114469/selection/e56188a106379c230ac2d84d996587f30db640f77e282b3ea14a783015615c94" "q-114469/selection/36fc61ecfa68d607e5bf5fa908e1a92d1be812fee4e01001acb97c3d8100ab8e" "q-114469/selection/c894e2b24406adf04a77938c2e5de816d19ed572b43e4129dc4cfbbdf5070008"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-114469" :question/id #uuid "3e210758-24a8-5827-bba0-96fda9d3e632" :question/math-academy-id "q-114469" :question/problem "Calculate $\\int \\frac{1}{{tan}^{2}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{5})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{5})+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{5})}\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "From the identity $1+{tan}^{2}⁡\\theta ={sec}^{2}⁡\\theta ,$ with $\\theta =2x+\\frac{\\pi }{5},$ we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1+{tan}^{2}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{5})={sec}^{2}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{5}).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into our integral gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1}{{tan}^{2}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{5})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{5})+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{5})}\\,\\text{d}x & = \\\\ \\int \\frac{1}{[{tan}^{2}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{5})+1]\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{5})}\\,\\text{d}x & = \\\\ \\int \\frac{1}{{sec}^{2}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{5})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{5})}\\,\\text{d}x & = \\\\ \\int \\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{5})}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{5})}\\,\\text{d}x & = \\\\ \\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{5})\\text{d}x & = \\\\ \\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x+\\frac{\\pi }{5})+C & .\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-114469/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "fe5822b4-c5d4-59a8-bd72-a41d3074e4e6"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-114469"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
